        mlcustomize/SELinux_relabel.ml: Set SELinux label on /.autorelabel
        mlcustomize/inject_virtio_win.ml: Move inspection data to sub-struct
        mlcustomize/inject_virtio_win.ml: Rename virtio_win_path function
        mlcustomize/inject_virtio_win.ml: Fix no-virtio-win case

  Surya Gupta (1):
        inject_virtio_win: use lazy handle to avoid 3 appliance launches

(cherry picked from commit 2ff110d77d842d9148c4da7f36d8b6344063ba51)
